   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "\u2022 Proves the design in a group you own, as the pilot\n\u2022 Early adopter groups can champion it\n\u2022 Onboarding can be partly scripted\n\u2022 Evidence from groups can support a later instance runner request",
