   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "\u2022 Group Owners may not act, which stalls reach\n\u2022 An Owner could pause or edit their runner\n\u2022 Runner IDs change at cutover, so STS list drift could cause\n   outages\n\u2022 Runner token theft would allow picking up that group's jobs and ID\n   tokens",
   "originalText": "\u2022 Group Owners may not act, which stalls reach\n\u2022 An Owner could pause or edit their runner\n\u2022 Runner IDs change at cutover, so STS list drift could cause\n   outages\n\u2022 Runner token theft would allow picking up that group's jobs and ID\n   tokens",
   "textAlign": "left",
